    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Ghost Tag! The official tournament of tag for ghosts. If you thought the afterlife was boring, this is going to change your mind forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ghosts can do pretty awesome things that make tag so much more interesting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/c62f4b10b0251b5ad9798985fac3991c.poster.avif?t=1728422065\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/c62f4b10b0251b5ad9798985fac3991c.webm?t=1728422065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/c62f4b10b0251b5ad9798985fac3991c.mp4?t=1728422065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vanish</strong> into thin air to escape dire situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/8e713fe5f207b42b1c7a677e24eb8cb6.poster.avif?t=1728422065\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/8e713fe5f207b42b1c7a677e24eb8cb6.webm?t=1728422065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/8e713fe5f207b42b1c7a677e24eb8cb6.mp4?t=1728422065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Possess</strong> objects to haunt your opponents in the most crazy and clever ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/2011251509a3138a898832368644a89b.poster.avif?t=1728422065\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/2011251509a3138a898832368644a89b.webm?t=1728422065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/2011251509a3138a898832368644a89b.mp4?t=1728422065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from <strong>more than 15 stages</strong> with the most mind-blowing gimmicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/2b2c98138b83ec48d3dc9cf4f393ed40.avif?t=1728422065\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as any of the <strong>18 ghost characters</strong>, each with their own backstory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to <strong>8 players</strong> can join!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So what are you waiting for? Are you capable of becoming the champion? Or are you going to crumble in defeat? Your next spooky party awaits in GHOST TAG!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Ghost Tag! The official tournament of tag for ghosts. If you thought the afterlife was boring, this is going to change your mind forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ghosts can do pretty awesome things that make tag so much more interesting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/c62f4b10b0251b5ad9798985fac3991c.poster.avif?t=1728422065\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/c62f4b10b0251b5ad9798985fac3991c.webm?t=1728422065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/c62f4b10b0251b5ad9798985fac3991c.mp4?t=1728422065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vanish</strong> into thin air to escape dire situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/8e713fe5f207b42b1c7a677e24eb8cb6.poster.avif?t=1728422065\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/8e713fe5f207b42b1c7a677e24eb8cb6.webm?t=1728422065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/8e713fe5f207b42b1c7a677e24eb8cb6.mp4?t=1728422065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Possess</strong> objects to haunt your opponents in the most crazy and clever ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/2011251509a3138a898832368644a89b.poster.avif?t=1728422065\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/2011251509a3138a898832368644a89b.webm?t=1728422065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/2011251509a3138a898832368644a89b.mp4?t=1728422065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from <strong>more than 15 stages</strong> with the most mind-blowing gimmicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078650/extras/2b2c98138b83ec48d3dc9cf4f393ed40.avif?t=1728422065\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as any of the <strong>18 ghost characters</strong>, each with their own backstory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to <strong>8 players</strong> can join!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So what are you waiting for? Are you capable of becoming the champion? Or are you going to crumble in defeat? Your next spooky party awaits in GHOST TAG!</p>",
    "short_description": "It's the classic game of tag, but for ghosts! In this multiplayer party game, you can use spectral super powers like vanishing and possessing objects to gain an edge on your opponents and be the tag champion!",
